Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 11:15:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/39] feat: Add deposit_count to daily snapshots, fix
 last_deposit_date logic
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- saveDailySnapshot: select + store deposit_count from vip_members into
  vip_daily_snapshots (previously missing — #Dep was imported to vip_members
  but never carried into the snapshot)
- Supabase: ALTER TABLE vip_daily_snapshots ADD COLUMN deposit_count integer
- Supabase: refresh_days_inactive() Step 1 now uses total_deposit > 0
  (was monthly_valid_bet > 0) — more accurate: total_deposit > 0 means
  the player actually made a deposit on that day, giving the true last_deposit_date

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
